Keep the overlay scrollbar in its idle (thin) form when touched.

On a touch device the Adwaita overlay scrollbar's hover/press expansion is
wrong: tapping or dragging near the edge blows the thumb up into the fat
desktop bar with a trough. WEBKIT_SCROLLBAR_NO_HOVER=1 (set by
deploy/runtime-common.sh) suppresses the expanded state on overlay
scrollbars in both paths:

- ScrollingTreeScrollingNodeDelegateCoordinated: drop the hover/press parts
  before they reach ScrollerCoordinated, so the async scroller keeps
  painting the idle thumb (and the sprite fast-path of
  webkit-scrollbar-sprite-and-smoothing.patch, which requires
  hovered/pressed == NoPart, stays active during drags).
- AdwaitaScrollbarPainter::paint: clear the parts for overlay scrollbars on
  the main-thread/legacy paint path.

Non-overlay (always-visible) scrollbars are unaffected. Unset or =0 keeps
upstream behavior.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/adwaita/AdwaitaScrollbarPainter.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/adwaita/AdwaitaScrollbarPainter.cpp
@@ -30,10 +30,31 @@
 
 #include "GraphicsContext.h"
 
+#include <cstdlib>
+#include <cstring>
+
 namespace WebCore::AdwaitaScrollbarPainter {
 
-void paint(GraphicsContext& graphicsContext, const IntRect& damageRect, const State& scrollbar)
+// WEBKIT_SCROLLBAR_NO_HOVER=1: never paint the expanded (hovered/pressed)
+// overlay scrollbar; the idle thin thumb is the only form. See
+// webkit-scrollbar-no-hover-expand.patch.
+static bool hoverExpandDisabled()
+{
+    static const bool disabled = [] {
+        const char* env = std::getenv("WEBKIT_SCROLLBAR_NO_HOVER");
+        return env && *env && std::strcmp(env, "0");
+    }();
+    return disabled;
+}
+
+void paint(GraphicsContext& graphicsContext, const IntRect& damageRect, const State& scrollbarIn)
 {
+    State scrollbar = scrollbarIn;
+    if (scrollbar.usesOverlayScrollbars && hoverExpandDisabled()) {
+        scrollbar.hoveredPart = NoPart;
+        scrollbar.pressedPart = NoPart;
+    }
+
     if (graphicsContext.paintingDisabled())
         return;
 
